 "name_en": "Warranty Claim Management – Customer Claim Processing (63Y)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Warranty Claim Management – Customer Claim Processing (63Y)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scenario lets you create a warranty claim for a reimbursement request of a supplier (based on a performed repair).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scenario, you create a claim, validate it for completeness and eligibility for reimbursement, determine the correct prices for material, labor activities, and so on.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Based on the validation support of the system, the claim analyst can make a transparent decision on the claim and perform the financial reimbursement to the customer.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create claim</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Validate and submit claim</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Discard claim</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Adjust claims</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform formal validation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform content validation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post claim</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reverse posting</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reject claim</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Close claims</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Keep transparency on requested and approved (reimbursement) amounts of a claim with the versioning concept</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save money by only paying claims that have a legal ground and by only paying the appropriate (negotiated) prices or rates</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>质保索赔管理 - 客户索赔处理 (63Y)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此场景允许您为供应商的报销请求创建担保索赔（基于已执行的维修）。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此场景中，创建索赔、验证索赔的完整性和报销资格、确定物料、人工活动等的正确价格。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">根据系统的验证支持，索赔分析员可以对索赔做出透明的决策，并向客户执行财务报销。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">验证并提交索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">放弃索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">调整索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行正式验证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行内容验证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">冲销过账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">拒绝索赔</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">关闭索赔</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc46d9fa9c1b84fd09579fdffbaf711d1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过版本化概念保持索赔的请求和批准（报销）金额的透明度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过仅支付有法律依据的索赔并仅支付适当的（协商的）价格或价格来节省资金</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
